text: >-
  August 17th: Paris to Omaha at 10:49am, and lands in Lincoln at noon. Flies to

  Wilmington on August 23rd, Wilmington back to Cairo on August 24th

  August 21st: Charlie was speaking at "Alex McFarland Speaker Series with
  Charlie

  Kirk" in North Myrtle Beach, SC

  September 2nd: Charlie was in Visalia, CA speaking at a private event at
  Visalia First

  Church

  September 4th: BTT From Cairo to Paris, France —arriving in Minot, ND on
  11:03am

  then flies from Minot to Provo an hour later arriving into Provo at 12:46pm

  September 5th: BND does a short test flight around Provo

  September 5th & 6th: Charlie was speaking at the Build Up Korea conference in

  Seoul, Korea

  September 10th: BTT departed Provo, UT at 7:14am local time

  September 11th: BTT departed Wilmington, DE for Cairo at 7:56am local time

  September 13th: BND Departs Provo at 12:57pm and goes to Goose Bay, Canada for

  fuel stop then continued onto Paris and then back home Cairo
